@* Both variants, both unavailable, and the text dims with them. The recipe asks has-[:disabled]
   of the input the label wraps — a <label> is never :disabled itself, so upstream's
   disabled:opacity-50 matched nothing here and a disabled toggle looked exactly like an enabled
   one. *@
<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
    <Toggle Disabled aria-label="Toggle disabled">Disabled</Toggle>
    <Toggle Variant="outline" Disabled aria-label="Toggle disabled outline">Disabled</Toggle>
</div>
